<https://wiki.example.org/lowercase-name> <https://schema.org/articleBody> "# Filename violation\n\n`lowercase-name.md` does not match `wiki.filename_pattern`\n(`[A-Za-z0-9_()-]+\\.md`), so `wiki lint` must report it." .
